      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/perryville_arkansas",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Perryville’s first log home, built by John Rison in 1844, still stands as the town’s oldest building.",
