      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perryville%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The current courthouse, built in 1888 for $4,000, was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1976.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
